# Line endings for this repository.
#
# The package is built and run on Linux (fnOS/Debian), and the locked upstream
# source patches are applied with `git apply`, which requires LF bytes. A
# Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise materialise CRLF
# in the working tree and break both the patch application and the NAS runtime
# files that the package ships.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` keeps every text file LF in the working tree on every
# platform, and Git normalises the index content to LF as well.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.jpg binary
*.JPEG binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.fpk binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary
*.wasm binary

# The fnpack SDK binary ships with the repository.
.agents/skills/fnnas-app-creator/bin/fnpack-1.2.3-linux-amd64 binary

# Locked upstream source patches are applied byte-exactly by `git apply`.
*.patch text eol=lf
*.diff text eol=lf

# Windows-only launchers stay LF as well: the packaged lifecycle scripts run
# through a POSIX shell on the NAS.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf